  <head>
    <ce:title>Microstructural evolution and mechanical properties of advanced alpha-beta titanium alloys for aerospace applications</ce:title>
    <ce:abstract>
      <ce:simple-para>The mechanical performance of titanium alloys heavily relies on elemental composition and heat treatment conditions. This study investigates the tensile properties, hardness, and density of various alpha, alpha-beta, and near-beta titanium alloys.</ce:simple-para>
    </ce:abstract>
  </head>
  <body>
    <ce:sections>
      <ce:section>
